; Informatica parameter file for the worked examples (also used by the self-test renderer).
; Mapping parameters ($$) are substituted into SQL; $DBConnection_* are session parameters
; that never appear inside SQL and must stay untouched in the XML.
; PostgreSQL date literals: use ISO (yyyy-mm-dd or yyyymmdd). mm/dd/yyyy depends on DateStyle (IC-26).
